{"id":"631811","name":"黄瓜鸡蛋卷","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/631811/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好食材，黄瓜切好。","img":"images/631811/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋放盐拌匀。","img":"images/631811/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"平底锅，到油。","img":"images/631811/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入鸡蛋液，撒黄瓜。","img":"images/631811/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"在一头卷起来，这样重复几次。","img":"images/631811/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"最后一次，放黄瓜片。","img":"images/631811/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"到鸡蛋液。","img":"images/631811/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"这样卷起来，小火多煎一会，煎至表面金黄。","img":"images/631811/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"切块，装盘。","img":"images/631811/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"美味，好吃。","img":"images/631811/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}